BT /F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 696.0 Tm (Helix Systems) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 678.0 Tm (Information Security Policy \(ISP-001, version 5.0\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 659.0 Tm (Fictional sample document created for testing the RAG chatbot. All organisations, people, figures) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 646.0 Tm (and contact details in it are invented.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 615.0 Tm (1. Purpose and scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 595.5 Tm (This policy protects Helix Systems' information and the customer data we hold. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 581.0 Tm (applies to all employees, contractors and interns, and to every device and system) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 566.5 Tm (used for Helix work.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 535.5 Tm (2. Data classification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 516.0 Tm (All information belongs to one of four classes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 498.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 498.5 Tm (Public: approved for anyone, such as the website and published press releases.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 481.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 481.0 Tm (Internal: for Helix staff only, such as the intranet and team plans.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 463.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 463.5 Tm (Confidential: limited to people who need it, such as contracts, salaries and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 449.0 Tm (source code.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 431.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 431.5 Tm (Restricted: the most sensitive data, such as customer payment data, health data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 417.0 Tm (and encryption keys. Restricted data is stored only in systems approved by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 402.5 Tm (Security and is never sent by email.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 371.5 Tm (3. Passwords and authentication) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 354.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 354.0 Tm (Passwords must be at least 14 characters long. Passphrases of four or more words) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 339.5 Tm (are encouraged.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 322.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 322.0 Tm (Multi-factor authentication is required for every system reachable from the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 307.5 Tm (internet and for every administrator account.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 290.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 290.0 Tm (Passwords are changed only when a compromise is suspected. There is no scheduled) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 275.5 Tm (password rotation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 258.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 258.0 Tm (Use the HelixVault password manager provided by IT, and never reuse your Helix) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 243.5 Tm (password on another site.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 226.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 226.0 Tm (Accounts lock for 15 minutes after 10 failed sign-in attempts.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 195.0 Tm (4. Access control) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 177.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 177.5 Tm (Access follows least privilege: people get only the access their role needs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 160.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 160.0 Tm (Access is requested through the IT service portal and approved by both the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 145.5 Tm (requester's manager and the system owner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 128.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 128.0 Tm (System owners review who has access every quarter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 110.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 110.5 Tm (Access is removed within 4 hours when someone is dismissed, and by the end of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 96.0 Tm (last working day when someone resigns.) Tj ET
0.45 g BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 40 Tm (Helix Systems | ISP-001 v5.0 | Internal | Page 1 of 3) Tj ET
