stream
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 689.0 Tm (5. Encryption) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 671.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 671.5 Tm (Confidential and Restricted data is encrypted at rest with AES-256.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 654.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 654.0 Tm (Data in transit uses TLS 1.2 or higher; TLS 1.3 is preferred.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 636.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 636.5 Tm (Every laptop uses full-disk encryption.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 619.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 619.0 Tm (Encryption keys are held in the managed key service and rotated every year.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 588.0 Tm (6. Devices) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 570.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 570.5 Tm (Restricted data may be handled only on company-issued laptops.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 553.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 553.0 Tm (Screens lock after 5 minutes without activity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 535.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 535.5 Tm (Operating system security updates are installed within 14 days, and critical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 521.0 Tm (updates within 72 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 503.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 503.5 Tm (A lost or stolen device must be reported to IT within 1 hour.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 486.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 486.0 Tm (Personal phones may be used for email and chat only, and only with the Helix) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 471.5 Tm (mobile management profile installed.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 440.5 Tm (7. Reporting security incidents) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 421.0 Tm (Report any suspected security incident within 1 hour to security@helix.example or in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 406.5 Tm (the #sec-incidents channel. Do not investigate it yourself. Use the Report Phishing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 392.0 Tm (button in your email client for suspicious messages.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 361.0 Tm (8. Acceptable use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 343.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 343.5 Tm (Do not put Confidential or Restricted data into AI tools that are not on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 329.0 Tm (Security's approved list.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 311.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 311.5 Tm (Do not store company files in personal cloud storage.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 294.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 294.0 Tm (Do not install software from outside the company software catalog without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 279.5 Tm (approval.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 248.5 Tm (9. Exceptions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 229.0 Tm (Exceptions are requested with the security exception form and must be approved by the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 214.5 Tm (Chief Information Security Officer \(CISO\). An exception lasts at most 6 months and is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 200.0 Tm (reviewed before it can be renewed.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 169.0 Tm (10. Enforcement and document control) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 149.5 Tm (Breaking this policy can lead to disciplinary action, up to and including dismissal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 135.0 Tm (Policy owner: CISO. Approved: 2 June 2026. Effective: 1 July 2026. This policy is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 120.5 Tm (reviewed every year.) Tj ET
0.45 g BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 40 Tm (Helix Systems | ISP-001 v5.0 | Internal | Page 3 of 3) Tj ET
